=========================================================================

This software is a landing-tier bridge that runs an unmodified overlay
services engine with a multicast delivery fabric as its transport. It
terminates a BEEF object delivery lane and hands each delivered object to
the engine's own submit interface with the topic it matched, so delivery
arrives as an ordinary client submission. It terminates a block header
lane into a local, proof-of-work-checked header store and serves that
store to the engine as its chain tracker, so SPV inside the engine checks
against headers the host itself received. A submit facade accepts client
broadcasts, forwards them to the local engine first, and publishes each
accepted submission once onto the object plane, in place of the engine's
own host-by-host propagation. The engine is not modified: no patched
ingest, no additional endpoint, and no change to validation or to
admittance.

