Third-Party Standards

This software transports objects conforming to published standards
maintained by BSV Blockchain, and to companion specifications of the BSV
multicast transaction distribution stack:

  BRC-22:  Overlay Network Data Synchronization
  BRC-24:  Overlay Network Lookup Services
  BRC-62:  Background Evaluation Extended Format (BEEF) Transactions
  BRC-88:  Overlay Services Synchronization Architecture (SHIP/SLAP)
  BSV Blockchain Standards Repository
  https://github.com/bsv-blockchain/BRCs/

  BRC-135: Multicast Block Header Frame Format
  BRC-148: Multicast Shard Domain Partitioning and the BEEF Object Plane
  BRC-149: Multicast BEEF Object Frame Format
  https://github.com/lightwebinc/bsv-multicast/

=========================================================================
Interoperability

This software interoperates with an overlay services engine over its
published network interfaces only: it submits objects to the engine's
BRC-22 submit endpoint, serves the engine a chain tracker over HTTP, and
serves the same BRC-22 submit interface to the engine's own clients. It
does not incorporate, link, or redistribute any overlay engine source
code, and it imports no engine module. The engine runs as released, in
TypeScript or Go:

  Overlay services engine and tooling (TypeScript)
  https://github.com/bsv-blockchain/ts-stack

  Overlay services engine (Go)
  https://github.com/bsv-blockchain/go-overlay-services

